    "description": "Objective\n\nShow Reps how long a Sign-Up has been waiting, in relative terms for the first week and as a date thereafter.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Formula field on Sign_Up__c rendering relative age (e.g. 1 min ago, 10 min ago, 3 hours ago) up to one week\n\n* Beyond one week, display the Sign-Up Date (first click timestamp, or record created date as fallback)\n\n* Display under the Player name in the Console list view\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Relative display for records under 7 days old; absolute date beyond that\n\n* Field appears under Player Name in Console list views\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nVerified in sandbox metadata: Sign_Up\\__c.Time_Since_Created_\\_c.\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 11. One-week cutoff refined 2026-07-17.",
